PARSFILE
#FullDataName CarSim Run Control`Chassis Flex: Flexible Chassis`Suspension and Ride Tests
#VEHICLECODE F_Ind_Ind
symbol_push  <<vehicle>> 0
symbol_push  <<unit>> 0
